<h2>Payment failed for your StudioFlow subscription</h2>

<p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.email %>,</p>

<p>
  We weren't able to process the payment for your StudioFlow
  <strong><%= @tier_label %></strong> subscription.
</p>

<p>
  Please update your payment method to avoid any disruption to your studio.
  We'll retry the charge automatically, but we recommend updating your card now.
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @billing_url %>">Update payment method →</a>
</p>

<p>
  Thanks,<br>
  The StudioFlow Team
</p>
